Hi, Jason,

How about:

td <- timeDate(c("05/01/1990", "06/02/1995",
                 "07/03/2001", "08/03/2003"))
period <- ifelse(td < timeDate("01/01/2001"),
                 "Twentieth Century",
                 "Twenty-First Century")
data.frame(Date1 = td, Period = period)

--sundar

