rle() is your friend in this case, i.e.,

mat1 <- apply(mat, 2, function(x) {
rl <- rle(x)
rep(rl$length, rl$lengths)
})

mat2 <- apply(mat, 2, function(x) {
rl <- rle(x)
unlist(lapply(rl$length, seq, from = 1))
})

where 'mat' is your original matrix.

I hope it helps.

